WEBVTT

00:31:58.602 --> 00:32:00.411
in terms of art or creativity.

00:32:00.435 --> 00:32:05.514
And yet, now you yourself have
been through as dark a night of the soul

00:32:05.538 --> 00:32:08.688
as anyone could, I think.

00:32:09.561 --> 00:32:12.095
So have you revised
your thinking about this?

00:32:12.119 --> 00:32:15.241
EG: No, I'm just laughing,
because what I want to say is that

00:32:15.265 --> 00:32:18.473
you don't have to seek out
dark nights of the soul.

00:32:18.497 --> 00:32:19.750
They will find you.

00:32:19.774 --> 00:32:22.913
Pain will find you.
Suffering will find you.

00:32:22.937 --> 00:32:27.279
When the time is ready for it,
when it's your turn to suffer,

00:32:27.303 --> 00:32:28.552
believe me, you'll suffer.

00:32:28.576 --> 00:32:32.195
You don't have to look for it,
you don't have to romanticize it,